meta {
  name: Get Receipt
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/orders/{{client_order_id}}/receipt
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{client_token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Get Receipt

  Returns the receipt of a **completed** order — an immutable snapshot taken
  the moment the order was completed: who ordered, which master did the job,
  every priced task as its own line, and the total on the last line.

  Task prices and the order discount can no longer change after completion,
  so the receipt never drifts from what the client was shown.

  Tasks left **without a price** are not listed on the receipt and do not
  count towards the total.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "order_id": 12,
      "number": "824-0036",
      "client_name": "Emil",
      "client_phone": "+99362111222",
      "master_name": "Gurban Azadow",
      "master_phone": "+99365111222",
      "category_name": "Сантехника",
      "subtotal": 100,
      "discount_percent": 10,
      "discount_amount": 10,
      "total": 90,
      "currency": "TMT",
      "items": [
        { "id": 1, "title": "Замена смесителя", "description": null, "price": 30 },
        { "id": 2, "title": "Прочистка сифона", "description": null, "price": 70 }
      ],
      "issued_at": "2026-08-24 11:31:00",
      "issued_date": "24.08.26",
      "issued_time": "11:31"
    }
  }
  ```

  **Errors:**
  - `404` — order not found, does not belong to this client, or is not
    completed yet (the receipt only exists after completion)
  - `401` — missing / invalid client token
}
